--- !u!114 &492051944
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 492051942}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d7e270f43288c0247a4da068c0f0bf0b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueText: {fileID: 1610420004}
  dialogueAudioSource: {fileID: 800932625}
  dialogueObjectsSnippets:
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'Mine and Maki''s tastes in decor can be... different
      at times. '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b7a311e8694a78a42ad7cd48ec6ab856, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'But one thing we agree on is light. It can get so dingy
      and depressing on this ship. '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 175d8b195e361744a8b1a43657edc4d2, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 6.5
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: 'I thought these pink lamps were a bit much when Maki
      got them, but they brighten the room up. '
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ac9b4d160aa713a439c25b5965f16e2b, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 5.5
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: Leadership have been telling us that we need to cut
      down on electricity usage recently though, so we can't keep them on as much.
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0e8d47028c7052b4897f683d18c469a2, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 7.5
  - dialogueSentenceEnglish: I wonder why...
    snippetVA: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9603429c373575e4890f29154c025f80, type: 3}
    snippetTime: 2
  currentSnippetIndex: 0
  isTesting: 1
